/T (Mr. Harish Kukreja, a long-standing mentor, visited the workshop to review project progress and provide technical guidance. He focused on validating the vehicle concept to ensure the highest standards of performance, safety, and reliability. Mr. Kukreja offered strategic advice on the technical approach, system integration, rigorous testing, and structured project management for the electric vehicle platform currently under-development. His guidance reinforced the importance of precision and continuous improvement.)
