/E (As a team driven by engineering curiosity and the desire to build and think big, we look up to organisations like Infineon that consistently evolve and push the limits of technology. Hence, when we got the opportunity to collaborate with Infineon Technologies as our executive sponsor, we were delighted and honoured.)
/Pg 18 0 R
