302 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 162 0 R
/E (Our partnership with Infineon Technologies began in 2023, and over the past three years, they have been a cornerstone of our journey. Their unwavering support has played a pivotal role in driving our technical growth and strengthening our capabilities as a team. We extend our heartfelt gratitude to Infineon for their trust and support. Infineon Technologies has been a cornerstone of our journey, playing a pivotal role in our growth and technical development. Their continued support for our electric vehicle initiatives reflects a shared commitment to sustainability and the future of mobility. Together, we aim to accelerate innovation, strengthen our technical capabilities, and build a strong partnership that allows us as a team to grow faster than ever. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
