/Title (The wires were routed such that they remained flush with the surface of the segment, ensuring that they do not exceed the height of any bus bars present in the assembly. This prevents interference with other components and ensures that no strain is applied at the end points of the wires. Alongside the temperature harness, the cell tap connections, previously implemented for voltage monitoring, were integrated using similar routing principles.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2246 0 R
/Next 2251 0 R
